<title>UK: Midland Bank sets 300 mln stg FRN.</title>
<headline>Midland Bank sets 300 mln stg FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MIDLAND BANK PLC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    13.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.959    FULL FEES   15 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.959</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
